From: David Edmundson <kde@davidedmundson.co.uk>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:42:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show Qt Virtual Keyboard in process on the lockscreen

---
 lookandfeel/CMakeLists.txt                    |   2 +
 lookandfeel/components/VirtualKeyboard.qml    |  69 ++++++++++
 .../components/VirtualKeyboardLoader.qml      | 120 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 191 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 lookandfeel/components/VirtualKeyboard.qml
 create mode 100644 lookandfeel/components/VirtualKeyboardLoader.qml

diff --git a/lookandfeel/CMakeLists.txt b/lookandfeel/CMakeLists.txt
index 822004bb18..d6dd84c1a0 100644
--- a/lookandfeel/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/lookandfeel/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -12,6 +12,8 @@ ecm_target_qml_sources(components SOURCES
     components/SessionManagementScreen.qml
     components/UserDelegate.qml
     components/UserList.qml
+    components/VirtualKeyboard.qml
